#42900
Chisha Village~
   Chisha village was created and completed by Xiaya.  It is a zone customized
for leveling and centered around a wide variety of players.  Storyline is of a
small village plagued by a Flame Champion.  The village is forced to live
partly above ground and the other half underground.  A few miniquests with the
zone were implemented, a shopkeeper, and a few EQ mobs as a result of
questing/hidden treasures.    
~
429 1536 4 0 0 0 255 0
S
#42901
On a Dirt Path~
   The path appears to widen a bit, and the influx of traffic dissipates into
the added space.  This dirt covered path seems to extend from here onward east
toward a village in the distance.  Although the road is subpar to what most
would be used to it appears to get the job done.  Despite its appearance,
footprints and other markings prove that it is anything but deserted.  It is
even quieter now, with only sounds from beyond the fences can be heard.  
Beyond the fences, it is now easily discernable that this village uses this
land to grow their food.  A noticeable smell of manure is almost unbearably
strong.  A fence lines the road, with several gates in place.  Many workers can
be seen on the other side of the fence, working hard upon their fields.    
~
429 4 0 0 0 1 255 0
D0
A small gate blocks the entrance to a field where row after row of grain has been planted.
~
gate~
1 0 42907
D1
A pathway consisting of dirt continues to the east towards a small village.
~
~
0 0 42902
D2
A small gate blocks the entrance to a field where row after row of grain has been planted.
~
gate~
1 0 42922
D3
A pathway made of dirt leads off to the west.
~
~
