#42906
Nearing a Small Village~
   The road widens even further as it reaches its destination, the village of
Chisha.  There are not many residents inside the actual village, apparently
most of them are working out in the field.  A few dogs and children can be seen
running around aimlessly from afar.  There are four main structures ahead, but
one could not easily gauge their purpose from this perspective.  There is a
clothesline off to the north and south where most of the housing appears to be
located.  Further east, the four main structures seem to be the main attraction
and the center of attention.    
~
429 4 0 0 0 1 255 0
D1
To the east is the main road of Chisha, approaching four structures.
~
~
0 0 42937
D3
A pathway made of dirt leads off to the west.
~
~
0 0 42905
S
#42907
In the grain fields~
   The fields of Chisha are quite large, with row after row of different grains
covering the entire chunk of land.  The smell of fertilizer emminates from the
ground.  The crops are in good health, with bright colors of yellow and green
covering the various types.  The fields have been cared for delicately, which
is obvious by the detail in which was used to seperate the rows.  
Sparratically throughout the field there are workers tending to the plants
which feed their entire village.  A dusty path is to the south.  The fields
continue to the north, and to the east.  To the west, a fence blocks the exit
away from the village.    
~
429 0 0 0 0 2 255 0
D0
Rows and rows of various types of grain line the field in this direction.
~
~
0 0 42908
D1
The fields continue in this direction, in the distance is the village of Chisha.
~
~
