#42937
Main Street~
   This is the main street going east and west throughout the village.  This
town appears to have a large amount of guards per capita to its villagers.  
The village itself is in very good condition other than a few scorch marks upon
some of the structures.  The smells of the village range from absolutely
amazing to filthy depending on where you're standing.  Although everyone seems
to be smiling, the general feeling of the people around the village seem
paranoid.    
~
