#42938
On a Dirt Path~
   This dirt covered path seems to extend from here onward east toward a
village in the distance.  Although the road is subpar to what most would be
used to it appears to get the job done.  Despite it's appearance, footprints
and other markings prove that it is anything but deserted.  Villagers walking
to and fro pay little attention to anything other than their destination, it
appears.  Little talking can be overheard, it's almost as if it is a bit too
quiet for such a well-used road.  A noticeable smell of manure is almost
unbearably strong.  A fence appears to line the dirt road expanding east.    
~
