#42940
The Center of Chisha~
   This is the epicenter of the village.  All around this area people sit upon
benches around the magnificent fountain in the center.  It has been turned
into, by the residents, a park of some sort.  Children are playing over next to
a small play area to the west.  The smell of fear that has appeared to
enveloped everyone isn't noticeable here.  If it weren't for the abundance of
guards one could almost forget this village was in turmoil.    
~
