#42947
A Dead End~
   The road seems to be a dead end with a bunch of abandoned and flame stricken
buildings lining the road.  They appear to be vacant with no life whatsoever
within them.  Whatever caused the damage here was extraordinary.  The blackened
marks of dancing flames are apparent on all of the surrounding houses and
shops.  This was, at one point, probably a very prominent business and upper
housing district but it is now left in ruins.    
~
