#42956
The Items of War~
   In the center of the room is an antique weapons forge used to make different
types of metal weapons.  Along all of the walls are a large variety of armor,
boots, gauntlets, swords, axes and other trinkets of destruction.  The heat
from the forge is almost unbearable and no one could stand to be in here long
without sweating uncontrollably.  Two long tables are between the customer and
the forge with a multitude of items placed upon them both.    
~
