#42967
An Underground Tunnel~
   This appears to be an underground bunker of some sort which has been
fashioned quite well.  There appears to be lit torches further ahead but it
gives off little to no light in this cramped space.  The walls appear to be
dirt but it has been hardened by an unknown substance to give support.  The
floor is made of crushed up stone and pebbles making it quite dangerous to run
upon.  There is a faint aroma of stale alcohol and sweat which seems to pour
from the walls and floor.  An echo of the rustle of the village can be heard
from above.  There is also a barely audible noise which appears to be coming
from the east.    
