#42979
Temple of the Alma Kinan~
   The temple was built in dedication to the Goddess Alma Kinan.  The lavish
decorations of the temple greatly surpass anything else found within the
village itself.  The walls are made of a pearly white marble and the trimming
is of gold coloring.  The floors are spotless and there is no tarnishing to
speak of.  The altar is made of pure gold with weird etchings carved into it.
There is a calming atmosphere within the temple, causing little doubt as to how
much it is revered.  Not many noises can be heard other than a few faint sounds
of chanting.    
~
