#42993
Entryway into the Chieftain Mansion~
   This is the entryway into the Chieftain Mansion.  The decorations in here
are surprisingly modest compared to the temple or other parts of the village.
There are weird symbols painted into the walls at various intervals.  The
floors are wooden with a few rune symbols almost burned into them, a sign of
protection.  A flag of Harmonia is hoisted up from the roof, paying homage to
the fallen Empire.  A huge ornate door is off to the west with strange carvings
etched into it.  A door leads off to the south with a an animal fur hanging
above it.    
~
