#42994
A Large Bedroom~
   This large bedroom almost appears as if Harmonia himself vomited into it.  
The Harmonian flag is hung behind a huge four post wooden bed.  A table sits in
the center of the room with a desk off to the northeastern corner.  A large
steel shield is on the wall opposite the bed with the Harmonian symbol carved
into it.  The only exit out is the way that one would enter.    
~
