#42995
Bedroom of the Chieftain~
   This is quite possibly the biggest room in the entire village.  Lining
almost the entire far wall is row after row of books placed meticulously upon
shelves.  A huge bed is placed in the southeastern corner with an animal fur
bed covering.  In the center of the room is a large Harmonian rug with a huge
ornate desk placed on top of it.  The lights from the chandelier twinkle light
throughout the entire room.  On the wall opposite the bookshelves are paintings
of fallen heroes.  One painting, in particular, is larger than the rest and is
painted in black and white.    
~
429 0 0 0 0 0 255 0
D1
~
ornate~
2 42926 42993
E
large painting~
   The painting depicts a rather tall gentlemen with a weird rune etched into
his neck.  Upon both arms he has a flame tattoo around his forearm.  His hair
is a dark black and his face appears to have seen many hard days.  The
strangest thing about the painting are his eyes, which have been painted an
aqua color despite the black and white theme.  At the bottom of the painting is
the words, 'From the flaming depths I protect.  '
~
S
#42996
&13The Tavern of Hugo&00~
   The Tavern of Hugo was named after its owner, rightfully so, and has a
reputation of having the best drinks available within a large radius.  It has
been said that the bartender once created drinks for Xerxes himself.  The
brightness within the tavern is a sheer night and day than the tunnel used to
access it.  In the center of the tavern there is a very large oak bar with
barstools placed strategically.  There are several tables surrounding the bar
within the main room with a small stage north of it.  However, this section of
the tavern is reserved mainly for entertainment and seating.  A surprisingly
large amount of people can be seen filing in and out of this establishment.  
~
