#42998
Hidden Chamber of the Alma Kinan~
   This would appear to be a hidden chamber within the bunker.  There is a
medium sized bed in the center of the room with two smaller ones against each
wall.  The entire room is decorated in a rich blue color which appears even
deeper with the lighting.  There is a very calming aroma within the room much
like incense being burned.  The crest of the Alma Kinan is hung upon the far
wall with a small altar below it.  Over behind the beds to the right is a large
bookcase with weird markings upon them.  To the left, there is a small area
which resembles a practice area for martial arts.    
~
