#42999
Chamber of the Silver Maiden~
   This chamber is probably one of the most gorgeous ones within the village.
The inhabitant is known throughout Chisha as the 'Silver Maiden'.  A rack of
various different weapons lines one wall with a chair and desk in front of it.
Off to the other side of the room there is a large bed covered in a bright
white set of linen.  There is an insignia below a pair of crossed swords above
the bed.  It is obvious that the person who lives in this room is greatly
revered by the Chishan people.    
~
